@startuml
title FlightOS timing subsystem architecture
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "High-level kernel" {
  [Timekeeping] as time
  [Clockevent core] as events
  [Tick policy] as tick
  [Watchdog policy] as watchdog
  [Clocksource abstraction] as source
  [Clockevent abstraction] as event
}

package "SPARC LEON implementation" {
  [Uptime setup] as uptime
  [Clockevent backend] as backend
  [GRTIMER long count] as longcount
  [GPTIMER register access] as gptimer
  [GRTIMER register access] as grtimer
  [SPARC timer IRQs] as irq
}

time --> source : elapsed time
events --> event : device lifecycle
tick --> events : tick device
watchdog --> events : watchdog device
uptime --> time : selected source
longcount --> uptime : LEON3
backend --> events : registered devices
gptimer --> backend : LEON3/4 timers
grtimer --> longcount : counter access
backend --> irq : expiry interrupt
@enduml
